# File: .clang-format
# Brief: CFG-DC-2 -- Google C++ Style, per CLAUDE.md 5.1
#
# Description:
# CLAUDE.md 5.1 requires the Google C++ Style Guide. Rather than restate its
# rules here (a second source that will drift), this inherits BasedOnStyle:
# Google and only records the two project-specific deviations below.
---
BasedOnStyle: Google
# 100 rather than Google's 80: this project's identifiers carry domain
# prefixes (chassis_ / rt_ / estop_) and 80 forces wraps that hide the
# structure of a call.
ColumnLimit: 100
# C++17 exactly (CLAUDE.md 5.2 / 13 CPP-1). Telling the formatter the
# standard keeps it from reformatting toward newer syntax.
Standard: c++17
